:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Intro
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<<if $hcItems.some(torch => torch.type is "torch" and torch.location is "held")>>
	<span class="narration">The gaoler gripped <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> torch tightly, and beheld who <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>>'d be guarding for the foreseeable future.</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="narration">The gaoler cautiously approached, and beheld who <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>>'d be guarding for the foreseeable future in the flickering torchlight.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

You kneel down. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> wears a dirty, bloodstained sack over most of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> body. There are crude holes cut for <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head and arms, with the legs going through what would be the top.
<br><br>

You shiver. Did <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> always exist in such filth? <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> huddles into <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>> as you approach. You flinch. It's the first time <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'s moved.
<br><br>

After a moment, you advance again. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> head slowly turns towards you. <span class="red">A single grey eye snaps to look at you as it catches the light of your torch. It burns with fear and hatred.</span> <<stress 40>><<gggstress>>
<br><br>

The other eye and <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> mouth are obscured behind dirty bandages. You stand perfectly still. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> curls back in on <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>>. Once more, you approach, as quiet as you can now. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> doesn't move, and <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye glazes back over. You examine <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> more closely. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s sickly, and what little skin you can see is very pale.
<br><br>

You were ordered to keep <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> alive. You'll need to change <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> bandages, or <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> probably won't even survive the night. <span class="blue">You can find bandages in the cloister's training area.</span>
<br><br>

It might help to wash <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> as well.
<<if $hcChallenge.waterEarly>>
	<span class="red">The water from the garden's well is foul,</span> but <span class="blue">you can still fill a wash bucket with water from the lake in the forest.</span> It's a bit of a walk, but needs must.
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">You can fill a wash bucket with water in the garden.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Undress Intro
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("undress")>>
<span class="narration">Modesty was a luxury, one not granted to the unholy.</span>
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s still mostly unresponsive. You won't get a better chance to get that dirty sack off of <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> silver manacles bind <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hands in front of <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, and the chain between them is attached to another chain, which itself is loosely bound to the wall.
They will make this difficult, but freeing <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> for even a moment could be dangerous.
<br><br>

<<link [[Just cut <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> 'clothes' away (0:01)|Hopeless Cycle Cell Undress Intro 2]]>><<pass 1>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
