:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Undress Intro 2
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<span class="narration">Everything <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> touched was treated as though it would come alive and taint any who beheld it.</span>
<br><br>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<wearProp "antique silver dagger">>
	<<run Object.assign($hcItems.find(clothes => clothes.name is "bloodstained sack" && clothes.location is "prisoner") ?? {}, { type: "clutter", name: "ruined fabric scraps", location: "cell", dirty: 2})>>
	You unsheathe your ceremonial dagger, and with a quick motion, stick it under the rough fabric. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> barely has time to react. You pull up, and it falls away.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> shudders, as if afraid of what you'll do next. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> tries to cover <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> exposure, but <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> manacles only allow <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> to cover <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> upper body.
<<else>>
	<<set _sack to $hcItems.find(clothes => clothes.name is "bloodstained sack" && clothes.location is "prisoner")>>
	<<if _sack>><<set _sack.location to "cell">><</if>>
	You work fast, unlocking each manacle. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> arms fall limply at <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> sides.
	<br><br>

	You grab the bottom of the sack and start to pull up. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> arms provide no resistance, but <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> breathing becomes heavy.
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> tries to push you away. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s not very strong, but you back away regardless, not wanting to be tainted by <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> touch.
	You move around <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, re-securing <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> manacles to the wall's inlet.
<</if>>
<br><br>

All that covers <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> now are the soiled bandages.
<<if $phase is 1>>
	You toss the remains of the sack aside. <span class="blue">It would be best to burn them during this evening's pyre.</span>
<<else>>
	You toss the sack aside. <span class="blue">It would be best to burn it during this evening's pyre.</span>
<</if>>
<br>
<span class="red">Leaving tainted items in the cell will degrade <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> health.</span>
<br><br>

