:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Bandages Intro
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<span class="narration">
	The gaoler found <<worldMale 'himself' 'herself'>> hesitating. Touching someone so tainted was no doubt dangerous.
	However, <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> had a duty to uphold, and <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> <<worldMale 'brothers' 'sisters' 'brothers and sisters'>> were counting on <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>>. If not <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>>, someone else would be made to do it.
</span>
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> stirs and lets out a ragged breath.
<br><br>

Your heart begins racing as that vacant, yet hateful, grey eye pierces right through you.
You reach towards <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> body. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> tries to push <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>> backwards away from you, but barely manages anything.
