<br>
<<link [[Tell <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> you're trying to help <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>|Hopeless Cycle Cell Bandages Intro Talk]]>><<stress 24>><<set $phase2 to 2>><<set $prisoner.love += 1>><<set $prisoner.talked += 1>><</link>><<ggstress>><<if $hc.handLocation is "guardhouse">><<hopelessCycleSus 2>><</if>>
