<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<<if $hc.handLocation is "guardhouse">><<hcSuspicion 5>><</if>>
<span class="narration">The gaoler wanted to minimise contact, and getting the witch to keep still would be the best way. How did <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> do it? Well...</span>
<br><br>

You take a deep breath. Speaking with prisoners is usually forbidden. What's more, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'s a witch, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> could snatch your voice right from your throat!
<br><br>

You decide that it's still your best chance to get <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> to cooperate. You tell <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> that you're trying to help <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, and that you need to remove <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> bandages to do so.
