<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<span class="narration">The gaoler wanted to minimise contact, and getting the witch to keep still would be the best way. How did <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> do it? Well...</span>
