You march up to the wall, grabbing the chain attached to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> manacles. You pull, slowly lifting <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> against the wall. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> lets out a nervous breath.
You secure the chain to its counterweight, holding <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> in place.
