<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> right arm is covered in deep bite marks. Human and beast alike.
<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> legs, and especially <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> thighs, are the worst so far. They're covered in cuts and bruises, some very fresh.
