:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Wash Intro 2
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<span class="narration">The witch should be grateful for this, the gaoler thought to <<worldMale 'himself' 'herself'>>. One thing could not become clean without another becoming dirty.</span>
