<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("legs") and $prisoner.love gte 30 or $prisoner.state is "catatonic">>
	You carry <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> to the middle of the cell.
<<else>>
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> crawls to the middle of the cell.
<</if>>
You prop <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> up in a kneeling position.
<br><br>

<<link [[Wash <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> quickly (0:10)|Hopeless Cycle Cell Wash 2]]>><<pass 10>><<trauma 12>><<arousal 600>><<purity -10>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<garousal>><<lpurity>>
