:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Wash 2
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<set $prisoner.cleanBody += 1>><<hcPrisonerHealth 1>>
	You show no regard for <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> pain, washing over <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> wounds<<if $prisonerBrands>> and brandings<</if>> quickly.
	<br><br>

	<<if $prisoner.state is "catatonic">>
		<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> grunts of pain are brief and shallow. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> slips back into a catatonic state as soon as you're done.
	<<else>>
		When you're done, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> lets out a quiet sigh of relief.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $prisoner.cleanBody += 2>><<hcPrisonerHealth 3>>
	<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("brand") and $prisonerBrands>>
		<<set _brands to $prisonerBrands.filter(brand => brand isnot "right cheek")>>
		You make sure to be careful around <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> wounds, and to clean each branding thoroughly.
		<br><br>

		<<if $prisonerBrands.includes("right cheek")>>
			You gently scrub the one on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> winces in pain, and <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> gaze is intense as your faces come close.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>

		You diligently clean away dead, burnt skin from <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> <<if _brands.length>><<print formatList(_brands, "and", true)>><<else>>brand<</if>>.
		<<if !$hc.daily.treated>>
			They seem to be causing a lot of pain. <span class="blue">You should treat them with medicinal herbs from the garden.</span>
		<<else>>
			They seem to be causing <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> a lot of pain, <span class="green">but less so now that you've treated them.</span>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		You make sure to be careful around <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> wounds.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $prisoner.state is "catatonic">>
		<<if $prisoner.health gte 8>>
			<span class="gold"><<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> starts to show signs of brief lucidity. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> hands clench and unclench.</span>
			<<set $prisoner.state to "lucid">>
		<<else>>
			<span class="red"><<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> barely reacts to your touch.</span>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $prisoner.love gte 45>>
			<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s clearly enjoying it. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> muscles all relax as you scrub the filth away.
		<<else>>
			The tension in <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> body fades. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> even seems to be enjoying it.
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if !$prisonerEvents.includes("hunger") and $hc.daysPassed gt 0>>
	<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("hunger")>>
	As you wash <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, you hear a low rumble. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> covers <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> abdomen.
	<br><br>

	Of course. No one's fed <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. That's your job now. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> must be starving. <span class="blue">You can get food for <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> in the cloister's dining hall.</span>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

You finish up.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Wash Hair
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<set $prisonerEvents.push("washHair")>>
<span class="narration">The gaoler heard tales of the hair of witches. Perhaps restoring its beauty would grant <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> strength.</span>
<br><br>

With <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head bandages no longer obstructing it, you start to scrub <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> scalp. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> tenses up for a moment, but relaxes into it. Much of it is clumped together by dried blood. You carefully scrub it away, but can't avoid breaking a few strands.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> hair is absolutely full of knots, too. You gently run your fingers down, doing your best to untangle it while pulling out as few hairs as possible.
<<if $prisonerBrands and $prisonerBrands.includes("right cheek")>>
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> winces whenever water runs down <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face and touches <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face branding, but sighs in contentment.
<<else>>
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> sighs in contentment.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $hcChallenge.faithBlooms>>
	With <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hair less matted and bloodied, you can see <span class="red">a bald spot on the back of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head, where a chunk of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hair had been ripped out</span>. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> squeezes <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eyes shut and looks away when your finger brushes it. You feel uneasy. This was not penance. This was cruelty, for cruelty's sake.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

After thirty minutes of untangling the knots while trying to avoid any contact with the antler, you give up and unsheathe your dagger. You show it to <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, and ask for <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> permission to continue. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> nods.
<br><br>

Very carefully, you cut out the most tangled bits. You additionally cut away some frayed ends. Finally, you cup water in your hands and rinse <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hair down.
<br><br>

You turn <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> around. Now soaked, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hair hangs straight down. It reaches <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> shoulders, and you can see that its natural shade is a deep brown. There are still streaks of grey within, it's hard to tell if they're faded from damage or ash.
It frames <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face, which looks almost vibrant and youthful now that you've cleaned <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> up.
<br><br>

You become lost in <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> beauty. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> skin looks radiant, the gentle curve of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> shoulders guiding your eyes down to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> breasts. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> wounds and bruises simply highlight an underlying perfection.
<<if $hcChallenge.faithBlooms>>
	The only flaws are the glass-like empty antler erupting from <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head, and the thin spot on the back of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head, only partly covered by the rest of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hair.
<<else>>
	The only flaw is the glass-like empty antler erupting from <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head.
<</if>>
You feel urges creeping in. <<arousal 2000>><<garousal>>
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> starts to blush as you continue to stare. You shake your head and snap out of it. You know those thoughts aren't your own. Is <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> still trying to bewitch you?
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Dump Water
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<<if !$prisonerEvents.includes("bandages")>>
	You decide that touching <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> is too great a risk. You simply dump the bucket of water over <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head.
<<else>>
	You dump the bucket of water over <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $prisoner.state is "catatonic">>
	<span class="red"><<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> barely even stirs, still mostly catatonic.</span>
<<elseif $prisoner.state is "asleep">>
	<<set $prisoner.state to "awake">><<set $prisoner.awakeTimer to 3>>
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> immediately wakes up and squirms against the brief torrent. When it's over, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> glares at you angrily.
<<elseif $prisoner.harmed gte Math.floor($prisoner.love / 10)>>
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> winces, but seems to have expected it. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> barely moves, simply sitting there, wet and miserable.
<<else>>
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> squeals and thrashes around. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s fortunate you even bothered to do this much.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Clean Clothes
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("newClothes")>>
<span class="narration"><<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> was wary of charity. Giving a gift to a witch could let <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> steal your heart.</span>
<br><br>

<<set _clothesCurrent to $hcItems.find(clothes => clothes.type is "clothes" and clothes.location is "prisoner")>>

You toss the _clothesCurrent.name on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> naked lap.
<<if $prisoner.state is "asleep">>
