<<else>>
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks down at it, confused.
<</if>>
You briefly unlock <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> shackles so <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> can slip it on.
<br><br>

You're unsure if this was a good idea. Having fresh clothes will look suspicious. It should help <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> stay healthy, though.
<br><br>

<<if $prisoner.loveRevealed>>
	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> gaze softens. <<gglove>>
<<else>>
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> glares at you, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye full of uncertainty.
	<<if _clothesCurrent.name is "torn vegetable sack">>
		You went out of your way to clean a useless, bloodstained sack for <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> doesn't seem to mind that it's still damp.
	<<else>>
		You were likely the last person <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> was expecting kindness from.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<set $prisoner.love += 5>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

