<</if>>
<<set $prisoner.hasEaten.pushUnique($hcFood)>>
<br><br>

<<if $prisoner.state is "catatonic">>
	When you're done, you try to pull <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> bandages back up. They won't stay anymore. They hang loosely by <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> neck.
	<br><br>

	You thought <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> would have been gagged under the bandages. You wonder if <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'ll try speaking to you once <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> returns to lucidity.
	<br><br>

