<span class="green"><<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> eye widens.</span>
<br><br>

After a moment of hesitation, <span class="green"><<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> raises <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> arm in a gesture of greeting</span>.
<br><br>

<<if $prisoner.love gte 25>>
	You never guessed <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'d be from your homeland. You're not sure how to feel.
<<else>>
	You feel dirty and ashamed to share a homeland with someone like this, but hide it. This is merely to get <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> to cooperate, after all.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Talk Intro Threaten
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<wearProp "whip" "khaki">>
With a practised elegance, you grab your whip and lash in <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> direction. It strikes the wall right next to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> ear.
<br><br>

<span class="red"><<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> doesn't even flinch.</span> <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> continues staring you down, now even more coldly.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Tongue
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("tongue")>>
<span class="narration">If the books are to be believed, the temple's punishments today are significantly more... 'elegant' than they were back in this time.</span>
<br><br>

Once you're close, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> slowly opens <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> mouth.
<br><br>

<span class="red"><<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> tongue is gone.</span>
<br><br>

There's a pattern of burns on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> inner cheek that line up with the outer burn. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> throat is burned, too. <<gggtrauma>><<trauma 50>>
<br><br>

You step back as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> closes <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> mouth. You feel cold.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Name
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<span class="narration">In a place such as this, a name was one of the most intimate things you could share. They both knew this well.</span>
<br><br>

You ask for <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> name.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> blinks at you.
<br><br>

You correct yourself, asking instead if you may know <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> name.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> thinks about it for a moment, before pointing at you. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> then lifts <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> wrist, the finger pointing up. 'You first.'
<br><br>

<<link [[Share your name|Hopeless Cycle Cell Name 2]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Name 2
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("talkName")>>
<span class="narration">While only the gaoler's family name is known, we know for certain what the witch was called. The townsfolk all referred to <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> as...</span>
<br><br>

You tell <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> your name. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> smiles and holds <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hands out in front of <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> in a cupped shape, motioning for you to do the same.
<br><br>

You copy <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> gently takes your hands, and with a single finger, traces the letters of your name. It takes <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> a few tries to spell it right. <<purity -1>><<lpurity>>
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> smiles at you brightly, seeming happy that you trusted <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> squeezes your hands, before tracing new letters in your palms.
<br><br>

An arch, a loop, another arch...
<br><br>

<span class="green">'Nona.'</span>
<br><br>

<<set $prisoner.name to "Nona">>
<<if $player.virginity.penile is "the witch">>
	<<set $player.virginity.penile to "Nona">>
<</if>>
<<if $player.virginity.handholding is "the witch">>
	<<set $player.virginity.handholding to "Nona">>
<</if>>
<<if $player.virginity.kiss is "the witch">>
	<<set $player.virginity.kiss to "Nona">>
<</if>>

You smile back, and greet <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> by name for the first time. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> squeezes your hands again. <<set $prisoner.loveRevealed to true>><<set $prisoner.love += 3>><<hopelessCycleLove 2>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Trick
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("talkMagic")>>

You ask <<= $prisoner.name>> if <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> knows any magic. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> blinks at you, before cupping <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hands in front of <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> motions for you to take them.
<br><br>

You do so. Your hands tingle. <<purity -3>><<lpurity>>
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> holds them for a moment. You can't help but notice how ladylike they are. You thought a witch would have long, rough fingers with claw-like nails.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> slowly pulls your hands up, until they cover <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> mouth. Your whole body tingles for a moment. Suddenly, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> coughs, and the tingling stops.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks at you apologetically before trying again. The feeling returns. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> slowly pulls your hands away. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> mouth is open. <span class="green">A pair of flowers emerge from within.</span>
<br><br>

<<run hcItemAdd({ type: "clutter", name: "witchblooms", nameText: "witchblooms", location: "cell", origin: "prisoner", dirty: 2})>>
They're a faint pinkish purple. You don't recognise the species. They look a little burnt and withered. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> gives you a sad smile.
<br><br>

This couldn't possibly be why they labelled <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> a witch. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> must be able to do more. You quickly suppose that anything more must require speech, but you're left wondering why <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> needed to take your hands.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Hair
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("talkHair")>>

<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> hair is finally clean, but it seems to be causing <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> some discomfort around the antler.
<br><br>

The <<worldFemale 'nuns' 'monks'>> helped you with your hair when you were an initiate, and taught you how to manage it. Now, you frequently help your <<worldFemale 'sisters' 'brothers'>> with their own hair. You turn <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> around and get to work. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> hair is no less unpleasant to touch than the rest of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> body. <<purity -5>><<trauma 6>><<llpurity>><<gtrauma>>
<br><br>

You direct <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hair away from the antler, and work it into a braid to keep it away. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> relaxes in your touch.
<br><br>

When you're done, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> turns to you and puts <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hands on your head. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> then makes a rotating motion with <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> wrist. 'Turn around.'
<br><br>

You understand. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> wants to help you with your hair, too.
<br><br>

<<link [[Let <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> (0:15)|Hopeless Cycle Cell Hair 2]]>><<pass 15>><<purity -5>><<set $prisoner.love += 3>><</link>><<lpurity>><<hopelessCycleLove 2>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Hair 2
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("talkHairLet")>><<set $hairtype to "braid right">><<set $hairposition to "front">>

You prop <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> up against the wall and turn around.
<br><br>

You feel your head tingle as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> starts to touch your hair. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> runs <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> fingers through it, seeming to enjoy the texture and feel. Despite the effects of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> touch, you find yourself relaxing at it.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> gently pulls it back and starts to give you a side braid of your own, although in a different style. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> must be experienced, as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> works fast.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> taps your shoulder when <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'s finished. You turn back around and <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> smiles brightly at you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Witchblooms
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("talkHairBlooms")>><<hcPrisonerHealth 1>>

You show <<= $prisoner.name>> the revitalised flowers. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> eye widens.
<br><br>

You sit behind <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, and undo the bottom of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> braid. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> can't ask, but you know <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'s wondering how you managed to purify them.
You tell <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> that you let them feed on your purity in your sleep.
<br><br>

You gently braid <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hair around the twin blooms. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> runs <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hand against them, smiling.
<<if $hcChallenge.faithBlooms>>
	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> fingers brush against <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> bald spot on the back of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head. For the first time, <span class="green">being reminded of it doesn't upset <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>></span>. Not anymore.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Despite everything, you've made <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> look and feel pretty. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> nearly topples you with a hug.
<br><br>

You look down at the blooms again. They shine radiantly, even with so little light. <span class="gold">If they can absorb your purity, perhaps they can absorb and ease <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> corruption, as well.</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Kiss
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("kiss")>><<set $prisoner.harmed -= 5>>
	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> hands hold your shoulders. You lean forward.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> lips meet yours. <<takeKissVirginity $prisoner.name "romantic">>
	<br><br>

	You both tense up. It seems physically painful for <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, likely because of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> burns. Meanwhile, the brief moment of bliss is cut by an inexplicable feeling of loss.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> eyes open, seductive and content. There's so much within them. Pain, but relief. Hatred, but love. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> pushes closer, keeping your lips together. <<stress -24>><<purity -10>><<llstress>><<llpurity>>
	<br><br>

	<span class="red">The world suddenly changes.</span> Your vision flashes in and out of some other location, but <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> remains before you. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s different too.
	<br><br>

	It flashes, over and over, to you on top of <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. You're on a stone altar, defiling <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> face, now crowned by a pair of elegant antlers, is overcome with ecstasy. You look up.
	You're in a small clearing in the forest. It's night time, but you can see perfectly in the red moonlight.
	Your <<worldMale 'brothers' 'sisters' 'brothers and sisters'>> lay unresponsive and entranced all around you. <<trauma 500>><<gggtrauma>>
	<br><br>

	You're back in the cell. You feel a cold absence. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s looking at you with an innocent, loving smile. It brings back your warmth.
<<else>>
	You hold <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> shoulders and prevent <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> from getting any closer. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> pushes against you, but you hold <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> firm.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> eye quivers as an expression of betrayal comes over <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> pushes away from you, back to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> spot near the wall. You reach for <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, but <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> hits your arm away.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> wipes the tears from <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye, and looks back up at you with <span class="red">hatred</span>.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

