<<set $hc.daily.cellSheet to true>>

You gently lay the sheet over <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> stirs for a moment, before pulling it closer over <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>>. <<hopelessCycleLove 1>>
